<title>ITALY: Milan Bourse trading to start at 1310 GMT.</title>
<headline>Milan Bourse trading to start at 1310 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Milan stock exchange, delayed due to technical problems, is due to begin at 1310 GMT, the Bourse computer centre said.</p>
<p>The trading session, which should have started at 0900 GMT, will end as usual at 1600 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
